{"4693790":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Survive The Apocalypse","steam_appid":4693790,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[4743500],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People believed in and voted for the wrong leaders. Before long, global warming transformed the world into an unforgiving desert. Now, it is time to abandon the sun-baked concrete ruins others still call a &quot;city.&quot;<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In your desperate journey to escape the wasteland, you will face:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural Urban Wasteland: Navigate through 11 distinct city districts filled with randomized zones, encounters, and valuable loot. No two runs are ever the same.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical Turn-Based Combat: Attack, wait or run.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep Survival Mechanics: Balance hunger, fatigue, and health. Scavenge for supplies, manage your stamina, and trade surplus items with wandering merchants.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching Skill Trees: Customize your playstyle with diverse skills ranging from combat perks to advanced cartography and survival capabilities.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Impactful Choices &amp; Permadeath: Every move is a risk. One wrong decision can lead to total disaster or hard-earned survival. You only live once - make every choice count.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4693790\/extras\/c8ac76ee6cdf15d6e30ae9f50193c92c.poster.avif?t=1793652642\" width=258 height=273 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4693790\/extras\/c8ac76ee6cdf15d6e30ae9f50193c92c.mp4?t=1793652642\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4693790\/extras\/075cd25824702d6bdcbe420bb8b393b5.webp?t=1793652642\"><img src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4693790\/extras\/075cd25824702d6bdcbe420bb8b393b5.poster.avif?t=1793652642\" class=\"bb_img\" width=332 height=592 \/><\/picture><\/span><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is how we do in this apocalyptic world!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive The Apocalypse!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People believed in and voted for the wrong leaders. Before long, global warming transformed the world into an unforgiving desert. Now, it is time to abandon the sun-baked concrete ruins others still call a &quot;city.&quot;<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In your desperate journey to escape the wasteland, you will face:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural Urban Wasteland: Navigate through 11 distinct city districts filled with randomized zones, encounters, and valuable loot. No two runs are ever the same.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical Turn-Based Combat: Attack, wait or run.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep Survival Mechanics: Balance hunger, fatigue, and health. Scavenge for supplies, manage your stamina, and trade surplus items with wandering merchants.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching Skill Trees: Customize your playstyle with diverse skills ranging from combat perks to advanced cartography and survival capabilities.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Impactful Choices &amp; Permadeath: Every move is a risk. One wrong decision can lead to total disaster or hard-earned survival. You only live once - make every choice count.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4693790\/extras\/c8ac76ee6cdf15d6e30ae9f50193c92c.poster.avif?t=1793652642\" width=258 height=273 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4693790\/extras\/c8ac76ee6cdf15d6e30ae9f50193c92c.mp4?t=1793652642\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4693790\/extras\/075cd25824702d6bdcbe420bb8b393b5.webp?t=1793652642\"><img src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4693790\/extras\/075cd25824702d6bdcbe420bb8b393b5.poster.avif?t=1793652642\" class=\"bb_img\" width=332 height=592 \/><\/picture><\/span><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is how we do in this apocalyptic world!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive The Apocalypse!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","short_description":"A turn-based survival roguelite set in a sun-baked urban wasteland. Fight, scavenge, and manage your needs through 11 procedural city districts. Every step is a choice with fatal consequences. Eat well, sleep well, and try not to die.","supported_languages":"English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4693790\/3bdc16a0b42ab2913b18b5a9037331496249ab61\/header.jpg?t=1793652642","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4693790\/206e10aa605544f31e58e077d2bcbe047fd9499b\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793652642","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/sha